# Common Mistakes

❌ I use computer every day.

✅ I use **a computer** every day.

---

❌ I use computer for coding and watching movie.

✅ I use my computer for coding and watching **movies**.

---

❌ Computer make our life easy.

✅ Computers make our lives **easier**.

---

❌ People use computer in office.

✅ People use computers in offices, schools, and homes.

---

# Band 8+ Tip

Instead of listing activities, explain **why** you use a computer and how it benefits you.

### ❌ Basic

> I use a computer for work.

### ✅ Band 8+

> I mainly use my computer for software development, online research, and continuous learning. Since my profession requires me to write and test code every day, it's an indispensable tool that allows me to work efficiently and stay up to date with the latest technologies.

